      "writtenOn": "2023-06-20T02:40:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I asked the owner before whether it can be transplanted to the stable branch, and the owner did not give a definite answer, and Qais also said that he could help with the backport and testing for 5.15 and 5.10.\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20230428112216.cftofdixwbl4hufm@airbuntu/\n\nI was also waiting to see if this patch can be ported to the stable branch, but it will be a long period. But now we find that due to this cpuset_rwsem, the performance of some scenes on Android 14 will have some performance regression compared to Android 13, so I porting this patch to 5.15 at now.",
      "parentUuid": "019430ef_aa671114",
      "revId": "053a1774b696bf712c78bdc1f0d9321c4e0a380b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
